Z||000000||AkursedX||04-29-2001||10:41 PM||||The stupid things that people will do to their cars, or in this case, trucks, will never cease to amaze me.....<P>I'm coming home from my friends house and I see the early 90's Chevy S-10.  It was red and it had a custom body kit, hood scoop, and painted red stock rims. All in all, it didn't look too bad. The thing that made this CHEVY S-10 so stupid was the fact that it had white stickers along the side of it that said "CAMARO"!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Need I say anymore??<P>||||reg||12
