Z||000003||FieroLisa||04-30-2001||12:12 AM||||K lemme tell you guys about a car I saw at OSU earlier this week- the thing was HORRID. it was, before mutilation, a white miata convertible, age undeterminable by the amount of ****  done to it.... it had every body panel mod you could imagine so it looked like a lumpy, scoopy piece of crap... it had stickers ALLLLL over it, and i mean all over it. I would not be exaggerating to say it had at least 5 stickers per body panel, japanese and otherwise.  But heres the best part- the interior- it had SNAKESKIN seat covers!! and then it had every single type of gauge that he could possibly get in there, as well as an unneeded, im sure, shift light.<P>this thing was absolutely sickening. i wish id had my camera at the time to document such a sad thing.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Cameron||04-30-2001||12:29 AM||||Oh my, that is pretty messed up.  What do people think about the F-150 Lightning.  It's like the 11th fastest 1/4 mile time now.  A truck...yes...it's basicly a lowered, ground effect, faster F-150.  Thing looks almost like the regular f-150 from the back...but the side it's pretty odvious.  If you pull up next to one, I would suggest you not try and race it.<P><P>------------------<BR>Cameron<BR> <A HREF="http://Fiero.NetMARC.com" TARGET=_blank>http://Fiero.NetMARC.com</A> ||||reg||1
