Z||000013||Spektyr||05-02-2001||05:19 AM||||Bah, cars like that are just like displaying the results of your IQ test.<P>For instance, the Cavalier RS... might as well just say "Room Temperature IQ".  RS stands for 'Rally Sport'.  Suuuuurre... keep telling yourself that.<P>A stock Del Sol means one of three things:<P>1.  I bought the car because it's cute and I'm a girl.<BR>2.  I bought the car because it's cute to get girls.<BR>3.  I bought the car because I'm dumb enough to think it's fast.<P>Highly modified it pretty much just re-affirms the old saying about a fool and his money.<P>People like that are just mobile road cones.  Something for me to drive around on the road so I don't get bored.||||reg||1
Z||000014||rogergarrison||05-02-2001||08:34 AM||||I had a sighting last nite. In an apartment complex just down the street, two guys were taping up a full length NIKE SWOOSH down the side of a lowered Toyota pickup with stick out hot wheels. It was maroon and they were making the stripe dayglow green and yellow right in the parking lot next to other residents cars. LMAO. I wonder how many cars there have the new custom flek paint jobs.||||reg||1
